# Test artifacts
*.txt
scratch_tst.cpp
-
run_tests.ps1
nul
# The .ch10 fixtures are large and mostly gitignored, EXCEPT the small
# (<100 MB) committed CI fixtures below, which the hosted CI needs. The full-size
# variants (e.g. the full PRN recording) stay local-only and are overlaid on the
# self-hosted runner. Ignore data/ contents, then re-include the committed set.
data/*
!data/agc_nzl_rasa_testfile.ch10
!data/agc_rnrz-l_trc_testfile.ch10
!data/prn_testfile.ch10
output/
!output/.gitkeep

# Test build outputs
debug/
release/
